城。", "start_year": 1387, "end_year": 1387, "time_original": "洪武二十年十一月己丑", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "8bb0780b-79b1-59ea-82fc-e5897d4950a0"}, {"title": "明廷赈济登州莱州饥荒", "description": "登州和莱州遭遇饥荒，朝廷下令赈济。", "start_year": 1388, "end_year": 1388, "time_original": "洪武二十年十二月", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "c14b6177-8097-5ad3-8f91-639598dbf081"}, {"title": "琉球等地向明廷入贡", "description": "本纪列出琉球、安南、高丽、占城、真腊、朵甘和乌斯藏在这一年入贡。 按原历纪年，事情发生在公元1387至1388年之间。", "start_year": null, "end_year": null, "time_original": "洪武二十年", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "aa912aec-1544-5ec8-89f5-97d3383cab09"}]'::jsonb)
